  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "S’mores & Stars! Free Seasonal Bonfires Included with your booking! Join us for complimentary fires: June 1–Aug 7, Sept 18–Oct 16, and Holiday weeks November & Dec. <br>30A Turtle Cove Retreat is a modern coastal haven designed for elevated group vacations along Florida’s scenic Highway 30A. Located in the heart of Santa Rosa Beach, this spacious 8-bedroom, 8-bathroom home spans multiple stories and blends sleek design with relaxed beach comfort—perfect for families, friends, and multi-generational stays.<br><br>Step into your private backyard oasis, where a sparkling pool sets the stage for laid-back afternoons and evening gatherings. Enjoy the shaded patio, comfortable outdoor seating, al fresco dining, and a BBQ grill ideal for sunset dinners and slow coastal evenings. Multiple balconies and two separate indoor living areas ensure everyone has space to spread out or come together.<br><br>Inside, the home is bright, stylish, and thoughtfully designed with clean lines and modern finishes throughout. The fully equipped kitchen makes group meals effortless, while the in-home washer and dryer add convenience for longer stays.<br><br>Beach days are easy and stress-free. Cruise to the beach in under five minutes using the provided golf cart or bikes, then return to rinse off and relax. Beach gear is conveniently stored in the garage, and on-site parking for up to four vehicles makes arrivals and departures seamless.<br><br>Whether you’re lounging poolside, gathering around the dining table, or soaking in coastal breezes from the balcony, 30A Turtle Cove Retreat delivers a refined yet relaxed beach experience—brought to you by Bonheur Vacations.<br><br>About the Area – 30A<br><br>Scenic Highway 30A is a 20-mile stretch of stunning beaches and charming coastal towns along Florida’s Emerald Coast. From Seaside to Laguna Beach, you’ll find sugar-white sand, emerald waters, boutique shopping, bike-friendly streets, and a laid-back coastal lifestyle. Each town has its own personality—perfect for exploring during your stay.<br><br>Nearby Attractions Include:<br><br>The Hub 30A<br><br>Gulf Place Plaza<br><br>Camp Helen State Park<br><br>Grayton Beach State Park<br><br>Henderson Beach State Park<br><br>Alys Beach<br><br>Seaside Beach<br><br>WaterColor Beach<br><br>Village of Baytowne Wharf<br><br>This home is not pet-friendly.<br><br>Pool heating is available for an additional fee and must be requested 24–48 hours prior to check-in.<br><br>Parking<br><br>Driveway parking available for up to 4 vehicles",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "30A Turtle Cove Retreat Modern 8BR with Private Pool, Bikes, and Golf Cart"
        }
      ],
